source_position":{"revision_id":1549947,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":171,"last_line":171,"line_start":0,"line_end":19,"raw_start":13551,"raw_end":13570,"raw_character_offsets":[13551,13552,13553,13554,13555,13556,13557,13558,13559,13560,13561,13562,13563,13564,13565,13566,13567,13568,13569],"projection_sha256":"5ff47489feefa6601941e1e582c71358c5895a7141cf6ed5b26c3933a9a34835"},"chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou","book_id":"b-houhanshu-042","work_id":"w-houhanshu","source_id":"s-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou-ws1549947"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p003","text":"荊猶不改。其後使巫祭祀祝詛，有司舉奏，請誅之，荊自殺。立二十九年死。帝憐傷之，賜謚曰思王。","mentions":[{"id":"c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p003:m0000","surface":"荊","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"6c9_c43_555_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou:p003:m0023","surface":"荊","start":23,"end":24,"person_id":"6c9_c43_555_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1549947,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":171,"last_line":171,"line_start":153,"line_end":198,"raw_start":13704,"raw_end":13749,"raw_character_offsets":[13704,13705,13706,13707,13708,13709,13710,13711,13712,13713,13714,13715,13716,13717,13718,13719,13720,13721,13722,13723,13724,13725,13726,13727,13728,13729,13730,13731,13732,13733,13734,13735,13736,13737,13738,13739,13740,13741,13742,13743,13744,13745,13746,13747,13748],"projection_sha256":"803b93f7f1b42289fd79e3aac70863f0568ff3063087a85e86f373965c4550d6"},"chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou","book_id":"b-houhanshu-042","work_id":"w-houhanshu","source_id":"s-houhanshu-042-zixiang-hou-ws1549947"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006","text":"上憐子響死，後遊華林園，見猿對跳子鳴嘯，上留目久之，因嗚咽流涕。豫章王嶷上表曰：「臣聞將而必戮，炳自《春秋》，罄于甸人，著於《經》《禮》，猶懷不忍之言，尚有如倫之痛。豈不事因法往，情以恩留。故庶人蛸子響，識懷靡樹，見淪不逞，肆憤一朝，取陷凶德，遂使迹隣非孝，事近無君，身膏草野，未云塞釁。但韔矢倒戈，歸罪司戮，卽理原心，亦旣迷而知返。釁骨不收，辜魂莫赦，撫事惟往，載傷心目。昔閔榮伏○，愴動墳園；思荊就辟，側懷丘墓。皆兩臣釁結於明時，二主議加於盛世，積代用之爲美，歷史不以云非。伏願一下天矝，爰詔蛸氏，使得安兆末郊，旋窆餘麓，微列葦輤之容，薄申封樹之禮。豈伊窮骸被德，實且天下歸仁。臣屬忝皇枝，偏留友睦，以臣繼別未安，子響言承出命，提攜鞠養，俯見成人，雖輟胤蕃條，歸體琁萼，循執之念不移，傅訓之憐何已。敢冒宸嚴，布此悲乞。」上不許。先是貶爲魚復侯。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006:m0002","surface":"子響","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006:m0035","surface":"嶷","start":35,"end":36,"person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006:m0099","surface":"子響","start":99,"end":101,"person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006:m0188","surface":"閔榮","start":188,"end":190,"person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAH","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006:m0198","surface":"思荊","start":198,"end":200,"person_id":"6c9_c43_555_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p006:m0309","surface":"子響","start":309,"end":311,"person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2272748,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":119,"last_line":119,"line_start":2,"line_end":380,"raw_start":8046,"raw_end":8424,"raw_character_offsets":[8046,8047,8048,8049,8050,8051,8052,8053,8054,8055,8056,8057,8058,8059,8060,8061,8062,8063,8064,8065,8066,8067,8068,8069,8070,8071,8072,8073,8074,8075,8076,8077,8078,8079,8080,8081,8082,8083,8084,8085,8086,8087,8088,8089,8090,8091,8092,8093,8094,8095,8096,8099,8100,8103,8104,8105,8106,8107,8108,8109,8110,8111,8112,8113,8114,8115,8116,8117,8118,811